# Copy to .github/CODEOWNERS in your project and change the paths and owner.
# Any PR that touches these paths then needs a review from the owner, if branch
# protection on the default branch has "Require review from Code Owners" turned on.
# The owner must be a different account from the one that opens the PR.
/tests/       @your-name
**/*.test.*   @your-name
**/__tests__/ @your-name
